# TrizenDialog Frontend Query

**Scope:** `trizendialog-frontend/` only.

## Query client — single source of truth

`src/app/queryClient.ts` owns global defaults.

Do **not** redefine `retry`, `staleTime`, `gcTime`, or `refetchOnWindowFocus` in hooks unless there is a **comment explaining why**.

```ts
// ✅ Justified override — message delivery stats change frequently
staleTime: 10_000

// ❌ Copy-paste on every feature
staleTime: 30_000
```

Recommended defaults (operations dashboard, not realtime terminal):

```text
staleTime: 60_000
gcTime: 5 * 60_000
retry: 1
refetchOnWindowFocus: false
refetchOnReconnect: true
```

## Query keys

Each feature owns `queryKeys.ts`. Never hardcode `['templates']` inline.

Paginated list keys must include `page`, `limit`, and active filters.

## Mutations

- Live in `features/{domain}/hooks/`, not pages
- Type generics on every `useMutation`
- Invalidate narrowly: `queryClient.invalidateQueries({ queryKey: templateKeys.all })`
- Toasts via `toastMutationError` / `toastMutationSuccess` from `lib/mutation-toast.ts`

## Forbidden

```ts
const { data } = useTemplates();
const [templates, setTemplates] = useState(data);

useEffect(() => { setTemplates(data); }, [data]);
```

Query data must not be copied into component state.

## Search debounce

API-backed search must be debounced (default **400ms**).

Use `src/hooks/use-debounced-value.ts`. No ad-hoc `setTimeout` in components.

## URL state

Filters, sorting, pagination, and search belong in URL search params when possible:

```text
/messages?page=2&status=FAILED
```

Use `src/hooks/use-table-params.ts`. Do not store table filters in Zustand or Context.

## Filter changes

Use `placeholderData: (prev) => prev` on paginated list queries so filter changes do not flash empty full-screen loaders.

## Polling

Default: **no** `refetchInterval`.

Polling requires a comment justifying near-real-time need (e.g. live message status). Forbidden on static config screens (templates, rules).

## Cache size

Paginated lists: rely on global `gcTime`.

`useInfiniteQuery` / message history screens: set explicit `gcTime` and document max cached pages.

## Blanket invalidation

```ts
// ❌
queryClient.invalidateQueries();
// ✅
queryClient.invalidateQueries({ queryKey: templateKeys.all });
```
